  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "4. What was actually in the file"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The PDF row printed the whole description and the whole category:"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Inventory 179.YK5005 CLEVIS KIT MERITOR TYPE 5/8\"Straight, 5/8in-18 Threads, 1/2in and 1/4in Pins, Pin C to C is 1-3/8in(E11430A, R810019) HD-Air Brakes & Air Suspension Iview Commercial Staging Lethbridge - 4310 7.00 $5.18 $11.26 $78.82 $42.56 54.0% 8 72 days 43.00"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Shortened to eighteen characters the description would have read "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "CLEVIS KIT MERITOR",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " and the category "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "HD-Air Brakes & Ai",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "5. What was ruled out"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not a reading problem in the file.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " A second, much shorter part was downloaded the same way and its description, "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Brake & Parts Cleaner",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " (21 characters), was also printed in full - so nothing at all is being shortened, not just the very long one."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not the spreadsheet.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The spreadsheet is supposed to carry the full text and it does. Only the PDF is wrong."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not the Part # column.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " Part # is correctly left alone, which is what the written description asks for."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not the page size.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The PDF is correctly A3 landscape and correctly titled "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Parts Velocity",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ", and the shop logo is printed."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "6. How often"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Every time. Three PDF downloads out of three, on three different searches."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "7. Where it was seen"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Reports > Parts Velocity, on the QA branch, build v3.5-16cf83f, on 6 August 2026."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " "
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Parts Velocity report specification, version 5, requirement S6-R6, which says: \"The PDF is formatted for A3 landscape, titled Parts Velocity. In the PDF, Description, Category, and Vendor are truncated to 18 characters. Part # is not truncated. The CSV carries the full, untruncated Description / Category / Vendor values.\""
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}